# JARDIM alone in the Corrigida, a win: Enter takes the controls screen down at 300, then the
# Wolf-like movement (docs/jardim/DESIGN.md "Decisions"): the closed-loop planner's holds
# (W, Shift+W for runs longer than 2.5 cells, Left/Right for the turns, timed in Wolf3D's 70-Hz
# tics), E for the doors and the exit doors, Space to fire. The same route rules as
# jardim-alone-win.input (crossbow first, shoot the Bussuf, Alemao, Siri, Chato and Bicho in a
# clear line ahead, walk around the rest, a medkit when health is low); phase 2 at 48.6 s, phase 3
# at 69.9 s, the final enemy touched at 126550 (lives 3, 1800 points): won 9720 (J1's fix: 10^9 /
# the milliseconds played since the controls screen went down, +7920).
#
